<title>UK: INSIGHT - Coffee likely to head lower, wipe out gains.</title>
<headline>INSIGHT - Coffee likely to head lower, wipe out gains.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> JULY	Close  * Support * Resist * RSI14 *   MA10 *   MA30</p>
<p> COFFEE    1,905  *  1,835  *  2,100 *   51  *  1,642 *  1,647</p>
<p>---------------VIEWS FROM THE MARKET - JUNE 6----------------</p>
<p>Robusta coffee futures are likely to fall further on Friday after recent profit-taking bouts as benchmark July starts to eye the start of last month's blistering rally as a new downside target.</p>
